 "rp_ready_series_bb": "Bullpen-ready routine for a reliever, about 6 minutes. Do 7 movements in order: 1) Arm circles, 10 forward and 10 back. 2) Band pull-aparts, 10. 3) Band 90/90 external rotation, 10 each arm. 4) Walking lunge with a reach, 5 each leg. 5) Two 10-yard build-up sprints at 75%. 6) Catch play, 15 throws building from 60 to 90 feet. 7) Mound throws, 8–10 pitches building to game effort. Ready, not spent. One round is the full routine, done in order.",
