 "wu_calf_softball_pin": "You need: massage ball. Pin the soleus/calf with a lacrosse ball — per side, total. Then dorsi- and plantarflex the ankle through the tender spot. Keep a steady, smooth rhythm until you reach the time or count shown above. One rep is: pin the soleus/calf with a lacrosse ball, then return to the start under control.",
